<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.1.1">
<l>vākkut tūymaiyi lāmaiyi ṉālē</l>
<l rend="indent">māta vāvuṉṉai vāykkoḷḷa māṭṭēṉ</l>
<l>nākku niṉṉaiyal lālaṟi yātu</l>
<l rend="indent">nāṉa tañcuva ṉeṉvaca maṉṟu</l>
<l>mūrkkup pēcukiṉ ṟāṉiva ṉeṉṟu</l>
<l rend="indent">muṉivā yēlumeṉ nāviṉuk kāṟṟēṉ</l>
<l>kākkai vāyiluṅ kaṭṭurai koḷvar</l>
<l rend="indent">kāra ṇākaru ḷakkoṭi yāṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Because [my] speech is impure, Mādhava,</l>
<l rend="indent">[my] mouth is unable to grasp you.</l>
<l>[But my] tongue knows nothing but you.</l>
<l rend="indent">I fear that is out of my control.</l>
<l>Even if [you] become angry, thinking,</l>
<l rend="indent">“this one speaks with arrogance,”</l>
<l>I cannot stop my tongue.</l>
<l rend="indent">Source! One with Garuḍa banner!</l>
<l>Even the declaration from the beak of a crow is fitting.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
